  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Youth of Faith Amplifying Regional Policy, Practices &amp; Processes in Climate Change in Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CYNESA seeks to address the lack of awareness and involvement of lay and religious Catholic of diverse ages in climate advocacy in Africa using Laudato Si&#x2019;. This is to be achieved through engagement with the structures/magisterium of the Catholic Church in Africa from the local church to regional associations of bishops&#x2019; conferences and congregations of religious women and men in Africa, and introduction of boys and girls to environmental policymaking advocacy through Catholic schools.</narrative>
  </description>
